<text format-version="0.2" work-id="w-nanqishu" book-id="b-nanqishu-050" chapter-id="c-nanqishu-050-appraisal" source-id="s-nanqishu-050-appraisal-ws2272731">
  <p id="c-nanqishu-050-appraisal:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">　　史臣曰：《春秋》書「鄭伯克段于鄢」，兄弟之恩離，君臣之義正。夫逆從有勢，況親兼一體，道窮數盡，或容觸啄。而<persName id="c-nanqishu-050-appraisal:p001:m0055" ref="w4m_9tw_147_B">寶玄</persName>自尋干戈，欣受家難。曾不悟執柯所指，跗蕚相從，以此而圖萬全，未知其髣髴也。</p>
  <p id="c-nanqishu-050-appraisal:p002" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">　　贊曰：文惠二王，于嗟夭殤。明子七國，終亦衰亡。</p>
</text>
